%% SnapList — POST /v1/items end to end, plus the one non-obvious failure path.
%% Actors are the components as they are named in docs/PLAN.md. Nothing in the "later"
%% column is implemented yet: only /health, /readyz and the 501 stubs exist today.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Seller
    participant M as Mobile (apps/mobile)
    participant A as API (apps/api)
    participant DB as Supabase Postgres
    participant S as Supabase Storage
    participant W as Worker (Modal)
    participant V as packages/vision

    Note over Seller,V: 1. capture -> upload -> job
    Seller->>M: photograph the garment (quad guide, auto-capture)
    M->>M: queue locally (offline-safe, expo-file-system + SQLite)
    M->>A: POST /v1/items (Idempotency-Key, bearer JWT)
    A->>DB: verify JWT -> user; check plan quota
    alt quota exhausted
        A-->>M: 402 {"error":{"code":"quota_exceeded"}}
        M-->>Seller: upsell sheet (states plan + limit)
    else quota available
        A->>DB: INSERT items(state=pending) + jobs(state=queued); usage_events(-1 unit)
        A->>S: create signed upload URL
        A-->>M: 202 {item_id, job_id, upload_url}
        M->>S: PUT photo
        M->>A: POST /v1/items/{id}/complete-upload  (or the worker detects the object)
    end

    Note over W,V: 2. GPU work, one job row, no Redis
    W->>DB: UPDATE jobs SET state='running' WHERE id IN (SELECT ... FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED)
    DB-->>W: one row (exactly one worker wins)
    W->>V: segment(photo) -> mask, matte(mask) -> alpha
    W->>V: rectify(alpha, category) -> flat-lay; prettify(flat) -> catalog image
    W->>V: attrs.extract(prettified) -> ItemAttributes  (JSON-schema enforced)
    alt all stages ok
        V-->>W: prettified.png, cutout.png, attributes.json
        W->>S: upload 3 artefacts
        W->>DB: INSERT assets; UPDATE jobs SET state='done'
    else terminal failure
        W->>DB: UPDATE jobs SET state='failed', reason_code=<one of five>
        W->>DB: usage_events(+1 refund, keyed by job_id)
    else retryable and attempts < 3
        W->>DB: UPDATE jobs SET state='queued', attempts=attempts+1 (backoff)
    end

    Note over M,DB: 3. poll -> render -> edit -> export
    loop every 2s while state != done|failed
        M->>A: GET /v1/jobs/{job_id}
        A->>DB: SELECT job (RLS: own rows only)
        A-->>M: Job {state, progress, reason_code}
    end
    M->>A: GET /v1/items/{item_id}
    A-->>M: AssetPack {prettified_url, cutout_url, on_model_urls, attributes}
    Seller->>M: correct an attribute chip
    M->>A: PATCH /v1/items/{id}/attributes (optimistic UI, rollback on error)
    A->>DB: UPDATE items.attributes (validated against ItemAttributes)
    M->>A: POST /v1/exports {marketplace:"ebay", item_ids:[...]}
    A-->>M: CSV rows (packages/shared/src/marketplaces/ebay.ts)
    M-->>Seller: preview the exact rows, then share or copy

    Note over Seller,A: 4. on-model is a separate, gated job (Pro only)
    Seller->>M: pick a model card, tap render
    M->>A: POST /v1/items/{id}/rerender {kind:"vton"}
    A->>DB: check plan allows on-model; enqueue new job (new quota unit)
    A-->>M: 202 {job_id}
    M->>A: GET /v1/jobs/{job_id}
    A-->>M: failed(reason_code="vton_rejected")  <-- quota refunded, no retry loop
